{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12216160","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12216160","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1221616001:0":{"text":"드디어 왔군.","source_cn":"回来了回来了，可算是等到人了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6ABD39A005380D05","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1221616002:0":{"text":"무… 슨 일이라도 있으십니까? 오늘 해야 할 일은 전부 다 했는데요… 아, 물론, 시키실 일이 더 있다고 해도 괜찮습니다!","source_cn":"有……什么事吗？今天的勤务应该都做好了……啊，要是还有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD73B880674D85AD7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1221616003:0":{"text":"오늘은 특별히 그쪽을 찾아온 거야. 오늘 일을 아주 깔끔히 잘했더군!","source_cn":"咱们兄弟可是专门来找你的。今天的勤务工作做得真是不错！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9711F487B5F717CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1221616004:0":{"text":"죄송합니다, 죄송합니다, 시정하겠… 네? 잘했다고요?","source_cn":"对不起对不起，我们一定改……诶？你说做得不错？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5AEFDC80B8A3DDCB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1221616005:0":{"text":"그래! 물귀신파와 한바탕 싸우고 돌아와 보니, 기분이 좋아 입이 찢어지겠더라고!","source_cn":"对啊！咱们和水鬼帮干了一架，刚才回来一看，可给咱们乐坏了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD7A8CE12413CD8E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1221616006:0":{"text":"물건도 아주 잘 정리되어 있고, 무기도 번쩍번쩍 빛이 나는 데다가, 오리 잡는 것까지 도와주다니. 하하.","source_cn":"东西摆得整整齐齐，武器擦得闪闪发光。听说你们还去帮忙赶...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA02386B3A3E8511","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1221616007:0":{"text":"오늘 저녁 식사는 너희에게 푸짐하게 대접하지!","source_cn":"今天的晚饭得算你们一份功劳！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0FD280A66638DF9C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1221616008:1":{"text":"그 말은… 저희를 칭찬하러 왔다는 말씀이신가요? 정말 의외네요…","source_cn":"你是说……你们是来夸我们的？真是没想到……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE76709BB4ACE2BC0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1221616009:0":{"text":"허, 우리도 깜짝 놀랐지 뭐야. 오늘 정말 잘했어.","source_cn":"嗐，我们也没想到啊。你们今天可真是干得漂亮。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE24DE2F1A16535C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1221616010:0":{"text":"아… 여러분이 저희에게 관심을 가져주시는 걸로도 충분합니다…","source_cn":"哦……要是兄弟们多关心关心我们，我们也满足了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x00D727910A796F76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:15:1221616010":{"text":"아… 여러분이 저희에게 관심을 가져주시는 걸로도 충분합니다…","source_cn":"哦……要是兄弟们多关心关心我们，我们也满足了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x00D727910A796F76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1221616011:0":{"text":"누가 아니래? 전에는 싸우지 않는 자들에겐 돈을 덜 나눠줘야 한다고 생각했는데… 사실 생각해보니 너희도 고생하더라고.","source_cn":"可不是，以前觉得你们不打架就该少分钱……唉，其实你们干...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB8AD887878297012","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1221616012:0":{"text":"그래서 이 일은 위에 보고하려고. 내일 바로 부두목에게 보고하도록 하지!","source_cn":"这件事儿得跟上头的人说，明天我们就去找二当家！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD0969F6EE4D59F3A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1221616015:0":{"text":"이… 이게 정말, 무슨 말을 해야 할지… 정말 감사합니다…","source_cn":"这……这真是，我都不知道怎么说……真是太好了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3748E30A68CE859","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1221616016:0":{"text":"다들 그렇게 생각하신다니 저희가 헛되이 일하진 않았네요. 다행이에요!","source_cn":"大家能这么想，证明我们没有白干活。太棒了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF1111ACF8777EE5C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:15:0:1":{"text":"월급을 더 줘야 할 것 같은데","source_cn":"该多发点工钱","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3501E98E03247FE1","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"월급을 더 줘야 할 것 같은데","female":"월급을 더 줘야 할 것 같은데","variant_male_record_index":"66688","variant_female_record_index":"66689","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1221616013:0":{"text":"내가 싸움만 할 줄 알았지, 말은 번지르르하게 잘 못 하니 이해하라고.","source_cn":"我是个粗人，光会打架，不会讲话，兄弟多担待啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE8050FB543C89D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1221616014:0":{"text":"전에는 미안했어. 일꾼이라고 함부로 대하면 안 되는 거였는데…","source_cn":"怪我们，以前不该对你们这么呼来喝去的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0240D847236E7933","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:15:1:2":{"text":"승진을 시켜줘야지","source_cn":"得提高些地位","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x397F0D8F86554D70","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"승진을 시켜줘야지","female":"승진을 시켜줘야지","variant_male_record_index":"66690","variant_female_record_index":"66691","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:血薇帮小头目":{"text":"블러디 로즈 작은 두목","source":"血薇帮小头目","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:老勤务工雅克":{"text":"심부름꾼 자크","source":"老勤务工雅克","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:血薇帮打手":{"text":"블러디 로즈 경호원","source":"血薇帮打手","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:血薇帮水手":{"text":"블러디 로즈 선원","source":"血薇帮水手","status":"matched_d